<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>改善客</title><link>https://gaishanke.cn/</link><description>Recent content on 改善客</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 16:33:57 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://gaishanke.cn/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Test 2</title><link>https://gaishanke.cn/posts/2026-08-30-test-2/</link><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 16:33:57 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gaishanke.cn/posts/2026-08-30-test-2/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Test 2&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Test 1</title><link>https://gaishanke.cn/posts/2026-08-30-test-1/</link><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 16:30:25 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gaishanke.cn/posts/2026-08-30-test-1/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Test 1&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Triple-hyde README.md</title><link>https://gaishanke.cn/posts/2026-08-30-triple-hyde-readme-md/</link><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 15:29:42 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gaishanke.cn/posts/2026-08-30-triple-hyde-readme-md/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="triple-hyde"&gt;Triple-hyde&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/derme302/triple-hyde/blob/master/LICENSE.md"&gt;&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-blue.svg?style=flat" alt="MIT license"&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/release/derme302/triple-hyde.svg" alt="GitHub release"&gt; &lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/stars/derme302/triple-hyde.svg" alt="GitHub stars"&gt; &lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/forks/derme302/triple-hyde.svg" alt="GitHub forks"&gt; &lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/issues/derme302/triple-hyde.svg" alt="GitHub issues"&gt; &lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/issues-closed/derme302/triple-hyde.svg" alt="GitHub issues closed"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;Triple-hyde&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is a &lt;a href="https://gohugo.io"&gt;Hugo&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rsquo;s theme that extends @htrn&amp;rsquo;s &lt;a href="https://github.com/htrn/hyde-hyde.git"&gt;Hyde-hyde&lt;/a&gt; theme that was originally derived from @spf13&amp;rsquo;s &lt;a href="https://github.com/spf13/hyde.git"&gt;Hyde&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://npf.io"&gt;Nate Finch&amp;rsquo;s blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="main-changes"&gt;Main changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;hyde-hyde&lt;/code&gt; has been paused in development for awhile, this fork implements the following changes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/derme302/triple-hyde/pull/1"&gt;PR #1&lt;/a&gt; adds support for Google Analytics v4&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/derme302/triple-hyde/pull/5"&gt;PR #5&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="https://github.com/eatingbrb"&gt;@eatingbrb&lt;/a&gt; adds support for Mastodon in social sidebar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/derme302/triple-hyde/pull/6"&gt;PR #6&lt;/a&gt; adds support for img shortcodes, allowing you to align an image inside of markdown by adding &lt;code&gt;#center&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;#left&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;#right&lt;/code&gt; at the end of an image link. E.g. &lt;code&gt;![Metal](/uploads/2014/06/metal_icon.png#center)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/derme302/triple-hyde/pull/7"&gt;PR #7&lt;/a&gt; correctly breaks out the about section on the sidebar as a partial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/derme302/triple-hyde/pull/10"&gt;PR #10&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="https://github.com/MarcoIeni"&gt;@MarcoIeni&lt;/a&gt; adds support for &lt;a href="https://giscus.app/"&gt;giscus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/derme302/triple-hyde/pull/11"&gt;PR #11&lt;/a&gt; adds internal Font Awesome 6 SVG Icon support and documentation from &lt;a href="https://blowfish.page"&gt;Blowfish&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/derme302/triple-hyde/pull/19"&gt;PR #19&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="https://github.com/burki169"&gt;burki169&lt;/a&gt; improves the display of international dates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more details, please refer to &lt;a href="https://github.com/derme302/triple-hyde/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md"&gt;CHANGELOG&lt;/a&gt;. A real site in action can be found &lt;a href="https://derme.coffee/"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; and the &lt;a href="https://derme.coffee/triple-hyde"&gt;example site&lt;/a&gt; for reference.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>My First Post</title><link>https://gaishanke.cn/posts/2026-08-30-my-first-post/</link><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 15:25:13 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gaishanke.cn/posts/2026-08-30-my-first-post/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="my-first-post"&gt;My First Post&lt;/h1&gt;</description></item><item><title>Hugo Quick Start Chinese</title><link>https://gaishanke.cn/posts/2026-08-30-hugo-quick-start-chinese/</link><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 12:33:27 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gaishanke.cn/posts/2026-08-30-hugo-quick-start-chinese/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="hugo-快速入门"&gt;Hugo 快速入门&lt;/h1&gt;
